@startuml
!include ../_theme.puml
title Callback Dispatch
top to bottom direction

rectangle "Callback Plan Intake" as Plan
rectangle "cb_ctx Build" as Ctx <<zoom>> [[dispatch_callbacks/build_cb_ctx.puml]]
rectangle "Callback Invocation" as Invoke
rectangle "Intent Collection" as Intents
rectangle "Commit/Apply Path" as Commit <<zoom>> [[dispatch_callbacks/commit_apply.puml]]
rectangle "Mask Violation Failure" as Fail

Plan --> Ctx : selects scheduled callback for
Ctx --> Invoke : supplies projected context to
Invoke --> Intents : returns callback result to
Intents --> Commit : enters commit path through
Ctx --> Fail : rejects mask violation through
Invoke --> Fail : rejects forbidden access through
@enduml
